  "title": "Coda Octopus Engineering Receives AS9100:D Certification",
  "summary": "Murray, Utah - Coda Octopus Engineering, a subsidiary of the Coda Octopus Group (NASDAQ: CODA), is pleased to announce that it has received its AS9100:D certification (including ISO9001:2015) for its quality management system. AS9100 is the International Quality Management System standard specifically for the Aerospace and Defense industry and provides…",
